sentences.text:
The petitioners shall furnish the bond in a sum of Rs.2,00,000/- (Rupees Two Lakhs only) each with two sureties each for the likesum to the satisfaction of the Investigating Officer;
b. The petitioners shall not commit similar offences;
c. The petitioners shall appear before the Investigating Officer or the court as and when required;
and d. The petitioners shall not threaten or tamper the prosecution witnesses.

